      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I count this as an accessbility mod. As someone with frequent and long spells of vertigo (unrelated to VR), it's most easily remedied by slow head movements and not moving my head too far up or down. CVRM was an absolute dream where the normal menu is placed far too low. I'm also aware it's necessary for others with similar issues and/or mobility issues. It's a one-line code change, please implement it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
